Usage: trtllm-serve [OPTIONS] MODEL

Options:
  --tp_size INTEGER            Tensor parallel size.  [default: 1]
  --host TEXT                  Host to bind.  [default: 127.0.0.1]
  --backend [pytorch|tensorrt]  Inference backend.  [default: pytorch]
  --trust_remote_code          Trust custom modeling code.
  --help                       Show this message and exit.
